OL,3,GNEWSAMP vows to help teenager access
OL,4,Alife-changing drug
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has vowed to help a 17-year-old
OL,7,Fwho is fighting for a life-changing
OL,8,Fdrug to be made available on the NHS.
OL,10,FBrogan Johnson, from Leigh-on-Sea,
OL,11,FEssex, cannot afford the medication
OL,12,Fthat would slow her Friedrich's ataxia
OL,13,Fcondition, which affects her heart,
OL,14,Fnervous system and mobility and is
OL,15,Flife-limiting.
OL,17,FThe drug, omaveloxolone, has been
OL,18,Fapproved for private use in the UK, but
OL,19,Fcosts about #1,000 a day.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
